        "original_id": "d8fc3cd6-b7c4-5530-8b0b-6e17cd51e7ef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Bambra, Steve Jackson, Ian Livingstone, Graeme Morris, Phil Gallagher\n- Products: Dungeons & Dragons, Fighting Fantasy, Warhammer, Night's Dark Terror, Eye of the Dragon, Star Wars\n- Topics: role-playing gamebooks, adventure modules, fantasy role-playing games\n\nFacts:\n- Fighting Fantasy is a series of single-player role-playing gamebooks created by Steve Jackson and Ian Livingstone.\n- Night's Dark Terror is an adventure module for the Dungeons & Dragons fantasy role-playing game written by Jim Bambra, Graeme Morris, and Phil Gallagher.\n- Eye of the Dragon is part of the Fighting Fantasy series created by Steve Jackson and Ian Livingstone.\n- Jim Bambra is particularly known for his contributions to Dungeons & Dragons, Fighting Fantasy, Warhammer, and a work based on the Star Wars films.",
